          <a href="#edges" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">5. Edges, Steps and Corners</a>
          <a href="#holes-leaks" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">6. Holes, Anchors and Leaks</a>
