        <!-- Closing -->
        <div class="mt-16 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Concrete repair products work when they are matched to the damage. Flexible sealants for moving cracks, epoxy for dormant structural ones, patchers for spalls, resurfacers for scaled surfaces, fast-set cement for broken steps and hydraulic cement for active leaks.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            The preparation is the same for all of them: sound edges, clean surfaces, the right moisture and the right temperature. Get those right and a mid-priced product outlasts an expensive one applied carelessly.
          </p>
